Plasma Death Scenario
Difficulty : 5
Bonus : 55
--------------------------------------------------------------
In earlier days, your Exovum ancestors built a large number of Mage Tors to help control the spread of the Human parasites.
But those days are long gone.  The Tors remain, but your Fryhtan Empire is reduced to a single Lair.
Reclaim ancient glory be exterminating these now proud descendants of our ancestor's slaves.  You will have seven years in which to cleans the world of all Human Kingdoms.

